jor global power increasingly identified as a key security concern in US Arctic strategy documents.\\",\\n      \\"term_type\\": \\"place\\",\\n      \\"confidence\\": 1.0\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"canonical_term\\": \\"Системы связи, управления, командования и разведки\\",\\n      \\"surface_forms\\": [\\n        \\"системы связи, управления, командования и разведки\\",\\n        \\"communication, command, control and intelligence systems\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"negative_surface_forms\\": [\\"гражданские коммуникационные системы\\"],\\n      \\"canonical_description\\": \\"Integrated military systems designed to ensure effective communication, command, control, and intelligence gathering for defense operations.\\",\\n      \\"term_type\\": \\"concept\\",\\n      \\"confidence\\": 0.95\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"canonical_term\\": \\"Военная инфраструктура\\",\\n      \\"surface_forms\\": [\\n        \\"военная инфраструктура\\",\\n        \\"military infrastructure\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"negative_surface_forms\\": [\\"гражданская инфраструктура\\"],\\n      \\"canonical_description\\": \\"Facilities and structures necessary for the operation and support of military forces, including bases, ports, and logistics networks.\\",\\n      \\"term_type\\": \\"concept\\",\\n      \\"confidence\\": 0.95\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"canonical_term\\": \\"Оборонное сотрудничество\\",\\n      \\"surface_forms\\": [\\n        \\"оборонное сотрудничество\\",\\n        \\"defense cooperation\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"negative_surface_forms\\": [\\"экономическое сотрудничество\\"],\\n      \\"canonical_description\\": \\"Collaboration between countries or organizations in the field of defense, including joint exercises, intelligence sharing, and military support.\\",\\n      \\"term_type\\": \\"concept\\",\\n      \\"confidence\\": 0.95\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"canonical_term\\": \\"Северная Европа\\",\\n      \\"surface_forms\\": [\\n        \\"Северная Европа\\",\\n        \\"Nordic countries\\",\\n        \\"Northern Europe\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"negative_surface_forms\\": [\\"Южная Европа\\"],\\n      \\"canonical_description\\": \\"A geographical region in Europe, including countries such as Finland and Sweden, with strategic importance in Arctic security.\\",\\n      \\"term_type\\": \\"place\\",\\n      \\"confidence\\": 0.95\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\"canonical_term\\": \\"Безопасность в Арктике\\",\\n      \\"surface_forms\\": [\\n        \\"арктическая безопасность\\",\\n        \\"security in the Arctic\\",\\n        \\"безопасность в Арктике\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\"negative_surface_forms\\": [\\"экономика Арктики\\"],\\n      \\"canonical_description\\": \\"The state of being protected from threats and risks in the Arctic region, encompassing military, environmental, and geopolitical dimensions.\\",\\n      \\"term_type\\": \\"concept\\",\\n      \\"confidence\\": 0.95\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\"extraction_metadata\\": {\\n    \\"total_terms\\": 19,\\n    \\"source_length\\": 6500,\\n    \\"language\\": \\"ru, en\\",\\n    \\"domain_indicators\\": [\\n      \\"geopolitics\\",\\n      \\"military strategy\\",\\n      \\"Arctic studies\\",\\n      \\"international relations\\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}", "type": "output_text", "parsed": {"extracted_terms": [{"term_type": "place", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["Арктика", "Arctic", "Arctic region"], "canonical_term": "Арктика", "canonical_description": "A polar region located at the northernmost part of Earth, characterized by extreme cold, ice-covered seas, and unique geopolitical significance.", "negative_surface_forms": ["Антарктика", "Antarctica"]}, {"term_type": "concept", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["военная стратегия США в Арктике", "US military strategy in the Arctic", "новая военная стратегия США в Арктике", "new US military strategy in the Arctic", "2024 Arctic Strategy"], "canonical_term": "Военная стратегия США в Арктике", "canonical_description": "A set of policies and plans formulated by the United States to address military interests, security, and presence in the Arctic region, with the latest version announced in July 2024.", "negative_surface_forms": ["гражданская стратегия США в Арктике"]}, {"term_type": "entity", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["Министерство обороны США", "Department of Defense", "DoD", "The Department of Defense"], "canonical_term": "Министерство обороны США", "canonical_description": "The executive branch department of the United States federal government responsible for coordinating and supervising all agencies and functions of the government directly related to national security and the armed forces.", "negative_surface_forms": ["Министерство обороны России"]}, {"term_type": "entity", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["Дж. Байден", "Joe Biden", "Biden", "Джозеф Байден"], "canonical_term": "Джозеф Байден", "canonical_description": "The 46th President of the United States, serving since January 2021, and a member of the Democratic Party.", "negative_surface_forms": ["Дональд Трамп"]}, {"term_type": "entity", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["Д. Трамп", "Donald Trump", "Trump", "Дональд Трамп"], "canonical_term": "Дональд Трамп", "canonical_description": "The 45th President of the United States, serving from 2017 to 2021, and a member of the Republican Party.", "negative_surface_forms": ["Джозеф Байден"]}, {"term_type": "entity", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["республиканцы", "Republicans", "Республиканская партия США", "Republican Party"], "canonical_term": "Республиканская партия США", "canonical_description": "One of the two major contemporary political parties in the United States, traditionally associated with conservative and right-leaning policies.", "negative_surface_forms": ["Демократическая партия США"]}, {"term_type": "entity", "confidence": 1.0, "surface_forms": ["демократы", "Democrats", "Демократическая партия США", "Democratic Party"], "canonical_term": "Демокр