e  Chinese  Threat\nfrom:  https://www.thearcticinstitute.org/defining-the-chinese-threat-in-the-\narctic/.  Accessed  January  23,  2021.\n\nSun,  Yun.  2020.  “Deﬁning\n\nin\n\nThe  State  Council  Information  Ofﬁce  of  the  People’s  Republic  of  China.  2018.\n“Press  Conference  on  China’s  Policy  and  Actions  on  Climate  Change  2018\nAnnual  Report”.  Retrieved  from:  http://www.scio.gov.cn/xwfbh/xwbfbh/\nwqfbh/37601/39346/index.htm.  Accessed  February  28,  2021.\n\nThe  White  House.  2021a.  “Remarks  by  President  Biden  on  America’s  Place  in\nthe  World”.  Retrieved  from:  https://www.whitehouse.gov/brieﬁng-room/\nspeeches-remarks/2021/02/04/remarks-by-president-biden-on-americas-\nplace-in-the-world/.  Accessed  September  1,  2022.\n\nThe  White  House.  2021b.  “Remarks  by  President  Biden  at  the  2021  Virtual\nfrom:  https://www.whitehouse.\n\nMunich  Security  Conference”.  Retrieved\ngov/brieﬁng-room/speeches-remarks/2021/02/19/remarks-by-president-\nbiden-at-the-2021-virtual-munich-security-conference/.  Accessed  March  2,\n2021.\n\nfor\n\nThe  White  House.  2022a.  National\n\nthe  Arctic  Region.\nStrategy\nfrom:  https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2022/\nRetrieved\n10/National-Strategy-for-the-Arctic-Region.pdf.  Accessed  October  29,  2022.\nThe  White  House.  2022b.  The  Guidance  on  Scientiﬁc  and  Technological  Cooper-\nation  with  the  Russian  Federation  for  US  Government  and  US  Government\nAfﬁliated  Organizations,  June  11,  2022.  Retrieved  from:  https://www.whi\ntehouse.gov/ostp/news-updates/2022/06/11/guidance-on-scientiﬁc-and-\ntechnological-cooperation-with-the-russian-federation-for-u-s-government-\nand-u-s-government-affiliated-organizations/.  Accessed  October  1,  2022.\nU.S.  Department  of  State.  2021.  “US-China  Joint  Glasgow  Declaration  on\nin  the  2020s”.  Retrieved  from:  https://www.\n\nEnhancing  Climate  Action\nstate.gov/u-s-china-joint-glasgow-declaration-on-enhancing-climate-action-\nin-the-2020s/.  Accessed  September  1,  2022.\n\nVarvitsioti,  Eleni  and  Williams,  Aime.  2022.  “Climate  Envoy  John  Kerry  Seeks\nRestart  to  US  Emissions  Talks  with  China”.  Financial  Times,  August  30,\n2022.  Retrieved  from:  https://www.ft.com/content/a1007c8b-4b9d-4ba1-\n8587-6cee53ed43fa.  Accessed  September  9,  2022.\n\n\f174\n\nX. QINGCHAO\n\nWang,  Yizhou.  2012.  “Creative  Involvement:  China’s  New  Diplomacy  in  My\n\nMind”.  World  Affairs,  1,  17–19.\n\nWikipedia.  2023.  “List  of  Research  Stations\n\nin  the  Arctic”.  Retrieved  from:\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_research_stations_in_the_Arctic.\nAccessed  March  26,  2023.\n\nWu,  Hui.  2007.  “An  Analysis  of  the  International  Law  of  the  Arctic  Race”.\n\nJournal  of  University  of  International  Relations,  5,  36–42.\n\nZhu,  Sheng.  2020.  “Norwegian  Expert:  China  Is  an  Important  Contributor\nto  the  Arctic  Knowledge  Base”.  Sina  News  (Chinese  version).  Retrieved\nfrom:  http://k.sina.com.cn/article_1686546714_6486a91a02000ymhl.html.\nAccessed  February  15,  2023.\n\n\n	skipped	{"skipped_at": "2025-08-11T22:38:35.103Z", "skip_reason": "All 16 terms were duplicates of already-processed terms"}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	5c6cfc62bcb3c5a6b724237d893347c87392d7c852e555d1659398fe36c6e814	\N	markitdown	gpt-4.1	tier_1	16607	66396	{"routing_info":{"status":"tier_1","model":"gpt-4.1","estimated_tokens":16607,"limit":380000,"reason":"Content fits in Tier 1 model (gpt-4.1)","cost_tier":"standard"},"original_metadata":{"service":"Ingest::TokenAwareMarkitdownService","file_path":"/Volumes/jer4TBv3/enliterator/arctic_research/China's Arctic Strategy_Qingchao.pdf","file_size_bytes":338727,"content_length_chars":66396,"estimated_tokens":16607,"timestamp":"2025-08-11T22:07:13Z","supported_formats":[".pdf",".docx",".pptx",".xlsx",".md",".txt",".html",".rtf",".odt",".jpg",".jpeg",".png",".bmp",".gif",".svg"]},"detection_result":{"media