ensuring sanitary and epidemiological well-being of\nthe population in the Arctic: materials of a scientific\nand  practical\ninternational\nparticipation\nIPK  Kosta  LLC,  2017).\nhttp://s-znc.ru/wp-\nRetrieved\ncontent/uploads/2017/05/%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0\n%BE%D1%80  %  D0%  BD%  D0%  B8%  D0%\nBA_%  D0%  BD%  D0%  BF%  D0%  BA_%  D0%\n90%  D1%  80%  D0%  BA%  D1%  82%  D0%  B8%\nD0% BA% D0 % B0.pdf\n\n(SPb:\nfrom:\n\n27.  Yu. A. Bolsunovskaya, G. Yu. Boyarko, Fund. res.\nfrom:\n\n(2014).  Retrieved\n\n2725-2728,\n\n9-12,\nhttp://www.fundamental-\nresearch.ru/ru/article/view?id=35423\n\npractical\n\nconference  with\n\n28.  A. Yu. Popova, Problems of maintaining health and\nensuring sanitary and epidemiological well-being of\nthe population in the Arctic: materials of a scientific\ninternational\nand\nIPK  Kosta  LLC,  2017).\nparticipation\nRetrieved\nhttp://s-znc.ru/wp-\ncontent/uploads/2017/05/%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0\n%BE%D1%80  %  D0%  BD%  D0%  B8%  D0%\nBA_%  D0%  BD%  D0%  BF%  D0%  BA_%  D0%\n90%  D1%  80%  D0%  BA%  D1%  82%  D0%  B8%\nD0% BA% D0 % B0.pdf\n\n(SPb:\nfrom:\n\n\fSHS Web of Conferences 112, 00028 (2021)\nNorthern Sustainable Development Forum 2020\n\nhttps://doi.org/10.1051/shsconf/202111200028\n\n29.  UNEP\n\n/  GEF  Project  Russian  Federation\nthe  National  Action  Plan  for\n\n-\nthe\nthe  Arctic  Marine  Environment\nfrom:\n\nSupporting\nProtection  of\n(2008).\nhttps://docplayer.ru/45130554-Proekt-rossiyskaya-\nfederaciya-podderzhka-nacionalnogo-plana-\ndeystviy-po-\nsredy.html\n\nzashchite-arkticheskoy-morskoy-\n\nRetrieved\n\n30.   U.  Vinokurova,  Yu.  Yakovets,  Arctic  Circumpolar\n\nCivilization (Novosibirsk: Nauka, 2016)\n31.  M.L.  Lagutina,  Russia’s  Arctic  Policy\n\nthe\nTwenty-First  Century.  National  and  International\nDimensions (Lexington Books, 2019)\n\nin\n\n6\n\n\n	skipped	{"skipped_at": "2025-08-11T22:38:35.124Z", "skip_reason": "All 12 terms were duplicates of already-processed terms"}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	d89224ae3f4a8